      <activity id="55b65f22-a343-51ec-8aa3-90fc48442f4a" activityNameId="03a160be-fd02-5639-bbda-ffe413df6165" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic panel, single-Si, Kioto Solar PVP-GExxxM, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic panel, single-Si, Kioto Solar PVP-GExxxM, at plant
The modules produced at Kioto Solar have a weight of 22kg/m2. The rated nominal power is about 125Wp/m2 (applies to modules with colour coating, 100% coverage).;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, monocrystalline, silicon; 
UUID: 77b6fd9e-4fc9-35cd-946e-6c3089bfd783
Electricity use, materials, transport of materials, treatment of production wastes. Disposal after end of life.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Unspecified
Time period: Time of publication.
Production volume: Approximately 99000 MW for total c-Si in 2018
Sampling: Based on literature data and producer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_77b6fd9e-4fc9-35cd-946e-6c3089bfd783.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
